 "script": [
  "In 2022 gas became the price of electricity. Europe's benchmark gas price peaked at €341 per MWh on 26 August 2022, about 17 times where it had been in January 2021.",
  "Because gas plants usually set the power price, that moved straight into electricity bills. For comparison, the latest price in our data is €85/MWh on 6 November 2026.",
  "This event is gas and carbon only: our power-price history starts in 2024, so we show what gas did and not what it did to prices then.",
  "That is why our gas pass-through is calibrated on prices back to 2021, not only the two years of power prices we hold."
